"entity": {
"name": "International Bancshares Corporation",
"description": "International Bancshares Corp. is a financial holding company, which provides banking services to commercial, consumer, and international customers in South, Central, and Southeast Texas and the State of Oklahoma. It engages in banking activities, including accepting checking and savings deposits and providing commercial, real estate, personal, home improvement, automobile, and other installment and term loans. It also offers other related services, such as credit cards, travelers' checks, safety deposit facilities, collection services, notary public services, escrow services, drive-up and walk-up facilities, and other customary banking services. The company was founded in 1966 and is headquartered in Laredo, TX.",
